{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50792","headline":"晚下彭泽 · 张祜","name":"晚下彭泽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斜日照鸟当，（「鸟当」，严疑当作「马当」。\n）孤舟下彭泽。\n平分江九派，敛度山一壁。\n浅浦横黑查，高林间白石。\n帆收天益暝，鸟没岚更碧。\n依依戍前鼓，稍稍村外笛。\n何处上面眠人，月明西楚客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}